      "rows": [
        {
          "dimension": "Smart-contract / protocol",
          "level": "Medium",
          "note": "Cairo is a purpose-built ZK language with a smaller auditor pool than Solidity; the September 2024 four-hour mainnet outage demonstrated real protocol fragility under load.",
          "source": "https://www.starknet.io/what-is-starknet/"
        },
        {
          "dimension": "Centralization",
          "level": "High",
          "note": "StarkWare controls the sequencer and prover; the 2025 staff cuts and split into two business units introduced execution risk at the single entity responsible for core protocol development.",
          "source": "https://x.com/StarkWareLtd/status/2063230462076576048"
        },
        {
          "dimension": "Regulatory",
          "level": "Medium",
          "note": "STRK20 shielded balances and the strkBTC private wrapper place Starknet squarely in the crosshairs of regulators targeting privacy-preserving DeFi rails, particularly in the EU and US.",
          "source": "https://www.starknet.io/blog/starknet-v0-14-2-the-privacy-engine-arrives/"
        },
        {
          "dimension": "Liquidity / market",
          "level": "High",
          "note": "STRK fell roughly 82% from its launch price and delivered approximately -50% ROI to last-round investors, compressing LP incentive budgets and weakening treasury-funded growth programs.",
          "source": ""
        },
        {
          "dimension": "Ecosystem fragmentation",
          "level": "Medium",
          "note": "The post-blob fee collapse compressed protocol revenue across all L2s; Starknet's survival as a top-5 L2 depends on retaining differentiated app flow — primarily privacy DEXs and perp venues — rather than generic transaction throughput.",
          "source": "https://docs.starknet.io/learn/protocol/data-availability"
        }
